{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And it shall be</b> — <b>and it shall rise up</b> [ועלתה]: in its plain sense, or like <b>and it shall be cut off</b> [ונכרתה], and thus <b>my bed shall rise</b> [יצועי עלה] — the meaning of עלה is <b>to cut off</b> and <b>to cease</b>."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:03.950369775Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}